SUMMARY:🎤 Saturday Night Karaoke at The Frog! 🐸🎶
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 15 Years!\n# 🎤 
 Saturday Night Karaoke at The Frog! 🐸🎶\n\n**Ready to grab the mic\, 
 sing your heart out\, and enjoy a fun night out?**\nJoin us at The Frog on
  Yonge Street\, just north of Sheppard Avenue\, for a Saturday night of ka
 raoke\, drinks\, and great company!\n\nWhether you're a seasoned performer
  who knows how to work a crowd or someone who prefers singing along from t
 he audience\, everyone is welcome. You don't need to be a great singer —
  you just need to be ready to have some fun!\n\n🎵 **THE PLAN**\n📅 **
 Saturday\, November 21st\, 2026**\n🕣 **Meetup time: 8:30 PM**\n🎤 **K
 araoke: 9:00 PM – Midnight**\n🍻 **Happy hour on drinks after 10:00 PM
 **\n\nAccessiblilty- this venue is fully wheelchair accessible\n\nWe'll me
 et up before the karaoke gets underway\, grab a spot\, socialize\, and get
  ready for a night of musical entertainment. When the singing starts\, it'
 s time to cheer on your fellow members — and maybe get up there and perf
 orm a song or two yourself!\n\n🍹 **BONUS: Happy hour starts after 10 PM
 !** So there's even more reason to stick around and enjoy the evening.\n\n
 **WHO SHOULD COME?**\n\n\\*People who love karaoke and singing along to th
 eir favourite songs.\n\n* Anyone looking to meet new people and enjoy a re
 laxed Saturday night.\n\\*Shower singers\, rock stars\, pop divas\, and ev
 eryone in between!\n\nCome solo or bring your enthusiasm. You don't have t
 o sing to join us — cheering on the performers is just as welcome.\n\n
 📍 **LOCATION:** The Frog\, Yonge Street\, just north of Sheppard Avenue
 . **everyone MUST spend at least $10 (plus tax and tip).**\n\nLet's make i
 t a great Saturday night. Pick your favourite song/s. \\*\\*1st timers to 
 colleen's events MUST e-transfer 5 to tommills@rogers.com\, and inform col
 leen RIGHT AWAY. 10 deposit for a guest). you will be refunded if/when you
 /they show up.\\*\\*🎶🍻\nSuggested Meetup title: 🎤 Saturday Night 
 Karaoke & Happy Hour at The Frog! 🐸\n\n📩 **Questions?**\n\nContact *
 *Colleen**\, your organizer\, by posting on the event page.
